      "post_id": "84470",
      "author_handle": "ShellMcGahan",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 15 years 9 months ago",
      "body": "I'm 7 weeks pregnant and as I have never had a baby before am very confused about what I'm feeling.\nBoobs sore already and getting bigger by the day and non of my clothes are fitting me either.\nI'm so tired I could fall asleep eating my meals some days.\nAnyone know any good places for maternity clothes and also do I start wearing maternity bras already or just get re sized??",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9358/#84470",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/4e940b7cf1bbdc126b9e.html",
      "page_url": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9358/",
