    },
    {
      "post_id": "84475",
      "author_handle": "shortie2",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 15 years 9 months ago",
      "body": "Hi and congrats.\nI didnt buy maternity clothes as i found places that i normally shop in (new look, dorothy perkins)didnt do mat clothes for fat folk like myself (around size 22/24) so instead i bought joggy bottoms and found comfort that way.  I didnt see the point of even checking ebay either cos i didnt see the point of pay 30 pound on clothes that i was only gonna wear for around 6/8 months or so. But thats just me.",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9358/#84475",
